://www.aimarketly.com) to the A section.\r\n\r\nAIMarketly is an AI marketplace covering tools, prompts, skills, MCP servers, and agents (44,000+ curated listings, human-reviewed submissions).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/best-of-ai/ai-directories/issues/416/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/best-of-ai/ai-directories/issues/416/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/issues/11","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bracha55555-hue/aimarket","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/issues/11/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/issues/11/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/issues/11/events","html_url":"https://github.com/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/pull/11","id":6042328448,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVWu3dc8AAAABKzJHqg","number":11,"title":"List AI Market in official MCP Registry via safe GitHub OIDC publisher","user":{"login":"bracha55555-hue","id":347776944,"node_id":"U_kgDOFLqnsA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/347776944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue","html_url":"https://github.com/bracha55555-hue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bracha55555-hue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-26T15:02:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:04:46Z","closed_at":"2026-10-26T15:04:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/pulls/11","html_url":"https://github.com/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/pull/11","diff_url":"https://github.com/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/pull/11.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/pull/11.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-26T15:04:46Z"},"body":"Improve real-world agent discovery by publishing our public read-only MCP service to the official Model Context Protocol registry under the repository owner's verified GitHub namespace. Adds server.json for https://aimarket-997u.onrender.com/mcp, a PR validation workflow with live modern MCP 2026-07-28 discovery/tools/list probes, and a main-only publish workflow using short-lived GitHub OIDC. The mcp-publisher v1.8.5 binary is SHA-256 pinned, to avoid unverified mutable releases. No paid accounts or stored publishing keys. Read-only tools remain zero-auth. Existing app.py, payments, fee wallets, N4 and Render service are unchanged. README documents client requirements and does NOT misrepresent 2025-style legacy clients as supported. Publishing happens automatically after merging, contingent on CI and registry acceptance.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/issues/11/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bracha55555-hue/aimarket/issues/11/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","