ps://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T06:35:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T17:19:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T17:18:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/pulls/236","html_url":"https://github.com/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/pull/236","diff_url":"https://github.com/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/pull/236.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/pull/236.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-25T17:18:59Z"},"body":"Seller draft edits queued behind an in-flight save could be admitted after an account change with the newer account’s credentials. Scope draft state, queues, retry identity and selection accounting to the existing authentication lifecycle, fencing request admission and late responses while preserving same-account remount and token-refresh saves. Initial, retry and explicit reads now preserve intervening committed saves and uncertain retry identity.\n\nIndependent review: full Astra056d7665 raised the read/save overlap issue; finding-raiser b64ce4a1 APPROVED the exact final delta. Full final CC55329ce6 APPROVE_WITH_NITS, 0HIGH/0MEDIUM, Fable5.1 HIGH aimarket, natural completion2026-10-25T17:15:33Z. CC’s one advisory LOW is a pre-existing same-seller edge case requiring an outstanding read across both a committed save and a later accepted lower-version reset; it does not block this release.\n\nVerification: qualified isolated strict-VM 8 lifecycle,8 overlap and1 uncertain-reload cases pass; authored probe76 normal and same76 StrictMode. TypeScript/lint/diff pass. Original final CI40170754044 passed4171 tests/248 files, including11 reload regressions, all11 job steps; actual testmerge c6789420 has exact final tree2fde12b1. CI history retained: initial0636 passed but missed review interleaving;83cf failed one old expectation, then0da strengthened it. No manual rerun. CC independently confirmed76+76 and directly read originalCI. Currentmain295fa has no overlap with the3 reviewed paths; no source rewrite.\n\nExact candidate0da4255101242e249885e99b2e2e4af9b0b1d1a0. No actual customer account/auth/backend/native/DB operation or exposure proof; production acceptance remains to be verified after normal release. All security holds and the full inherited audit remain open.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/issues/236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/issues/236/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https:/