","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxrobbins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T04:43:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T16:06:22Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T16:06:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/pulls/234","html_url":"https://github.com/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/pull/234","diff_url":"https://github.com/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/pull/234.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/pull/234.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-25T16:06:22Z"},"body":"Buyers with current backend order statuses such as delivered or completed can see a misleading Buy Now button and miss purchase-history download links. Align frontend types and presentation with all 12 canonical statuses, retain explicit legacy compatibility, and route recognized purchases to the existing order. Preserve Retry for a current accepted checkout claim before showing an ordinary existing purchase.\n\nValidation on a7e016e803cc4325014887dc3da0468fd7d448b1: independent root actual-component captures passed 74 original plus 54 recovery invocations using strict fake ports; typecheck and focused lint passed. The original PR CI 40163965535 passed all 11 steps, with 4,221 tests across 249 files including 64 status/recovery tests; actual test-merge tree equals candidate tree. The recovery invocations include repeated fresh mounts, not 54 unique paths. No local Vitest, real checkout, payment or customer-data probe was run.\n\nIndependent Astra full review 889f5d46 plus raiser follow-up 9f920a14 approved the recovery correction. Full final CC 3bc78685 completed naturally 2026-10-25 16:04:01Z: APPROVE_WITH_NITS, zero HIGH/MEDIUM. It independently read all seven files, backend contracts at the supplied pin, and qualified fake-port captures. Actual normal CLI requested Fable 5.1 HIGH on aimarket; this is not provider-served model attestation. Earlier quota exhaustion returned no verdict and remains historical.\n\nAdvisory limits retained: in a flag-off legacy checkout rollback, suppressing an unpaid created order is stricter than that backend's order reuse behavior; current live flags were not checked by the reviewer. In the production domain design, an abandoned unpaid reservation already lacks a payment continuation path; this repair makes the existing order visible and does not resolve that separate recovery issue. The pre-existing seller notice keyed only to fulfilled and future status-list typing are advisory follow-ups. No speculative fix, payment replay or browser-storage acceptance is claimed. Production adoption and read-only operator verification are recorded separately after release.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/issues/234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aidotmarket/ai-market-frontend/issues/234/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":