DOTs7x6c8AAAABKlLM-g","number":46,"title":"AI Film v2 (phase 1): server projects, 60 s chained scenes, per-second billing","user":{"login":"hoang0650","id":48677925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4Njc3OTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48677925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650","html_url":"https://github.com/hoang0650","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hoang0650/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:12:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T13:12:56Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T13:12:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoang0650/ai-marketplace-api/pulls/46","html_url":"https://github.com/hoang0650/ai-marketplace-api/pull/46","diff_url":"https://github.com/hoang0650/ai-marketplace-api/pull/46.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/hoang0650/ai-marketplace-api/pull/46.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-25T13:12:56Z"},"body":"Phase 1 of the approved AI Film plan (API side; GPU/AI work stays in ai-marketplace-ai).\n\n- `FilmProject` (≤120 min): scenes (5–60 s) → Wan shots (5/8/10/15 s), per-shot version history, uploads + music in private MinIO `aimarkets/film/{user}/{project}/…` (presigned PUT/GET only; nothing on the RunPod network volume).\n- `/v1/studio/film`: config, projects CRUD, uploads (presign + confirm/probe), estimate, scene generate, render (ffmpeg join in the AI service), media links, jobs.\n- Billing: Wan 2.2 I2V 720p $0.06/s and Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 $0.02/image × 1.32 → $0.0792/s, $0.0264/image. Debit under `withWalletLock` + spendable balance before submit; `expectedPrice` required (estimate shown first); submit failure credited back at once; unproduced shots/images refunded exactly once on settle. No free daily quota for film.\n- `/quota` reports real availability from AI health (5090, RunPod film, TTS) per kind.\n- `/video/fast` falls back to one 5 s RunPod shot when the 5090 is unreachable (per-second price, no free quota).\n- Poller settles film jobs; legacy JOB_ACTIVE ignores film jobs.\n\nTests: `npm test` 511/511 (9 new in test/studio/film-v2.test.js). No new env vars.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoang0650/ai-marketplace-api/issues/46/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hoang0650/ai-marketplace-api/issues/46/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1210556,"client_id":"Iv23liGzp2hacMWjAyXc","slug":"cursor","node_id":"A_kwHOB44z8s4AEni8","owner":{"login":"cursor","id":126759922,"node_id":"O_kgDOB44z8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126759922?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor","html_url":"https://github.com/cursor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/