: ⚡ Productivity & Workspaces (104 Servers)","user":{"login":"tonylate520","id":313957151,"node_id":"U_kgDOErabHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/313957151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520","html_url":"https://github.com/tonylate520","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonylate520/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-10-12T07:47:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:52:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## ⚡ Productivity & Workspaces (104 Servers) — Maintainer Recognition & 1-Click Config Index\n\nThank you to all open-source maintainers featured in the **⚡ Productivity & Workspaces (104 Servers)** category of **[MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com)**!\n\nEach server listed below now includes:\n1. ⚡ **Interactive 1-Click Config Generator** for Claude Desktop, Cursor IDE, and Windsurf.\n2. 💻 **Terminal CLI Support**: Users can install directly via `npx mcp-serverlist --add <slug>` (or `npx mcp-init`).\n3. 🏷️ **Dynamic SVG README Badge**: Copy the snippet in the table below to display real-time verification & stars on your repository README.\n\n> 💡 **Maintainers**: Reply to this thread if you would like to update your environment variable schema, runtime arguments, or claim the official **Verified Maintainer** status on [mcp-serverlist.com](https://mcp-serverlist.com).\n\n### Part 1 — Indexed Maintainers & Projects (40)\n\n| MCP Server | Maintainer | Live 1-Click Config | Verified Badge Snippet |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| [**N8n MCP**](https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n) | @n8n-io | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/n8n) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/n8n)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/n8n)` |\n| [**Awesome Claude Skills MCP**](https://github.com/ComposioHQ/awesome-claude-skills) | @ComposioHQ | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/awesome-claude-skills) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/awesome-claude-skills)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/awesome-claude-skills)` |\n| [**Mempalace MCP**](https://github.com/MemPalace/mempalace) | @MemPalace | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/mempalace) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/mempalace)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/mempalace)` |\n| [**Ai Agent Book MCP**](https://github.com/bojieli/ai-agent-book) | @bojieli | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/ai-agent-book) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/ai-agent-book)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/ai-agent-book)` |\n| [**Agentic Awesome Skills MCP**](https://github.com/sickn33/agentic-awesome-skills) | @sickn33 | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/agentic-awesome-skills) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://mcp-serverlist.com/api/badge/agentic-awesome-skills)](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/agentic-awesome-skills)` |\n| [**Siyuan MCP**](https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan) | @siyuan-note | [⚡ Configure](https://mcp-serverlist.com/mcp/siyuan) | `[![MCP ServerList](https://